+## Norm and simultaneous canonical transformation
+
+In the independent joint architecture, the direct volume norm is
+
+\[
+ N_{\rm vol}=1+\langle1\rangle_P\simeq2,
+ \qquad N_\Sigma=1+\langle\nu^{-1}\rangle_P=Z.                     \tag{6}
+\]
