+
+**All interactions transform at the same time:**
+
+\[
+ K_{s,c}=K_s/Z,\quad K_{g,c}=K_g/Z,\quad
+ (YH)_c=Z_L^{-1/2}(YH)Z_R^{-1/2}=(YH)/Z.                         \tag{8}
+\]
